    "body": "Keep project management data reviewable and recoverable alongside source.\n\nAcceptance criteria:\n- Create a public GitHub Project linked to this repository when project-scoped authentication is available.\n- Add initial issues and configure Todo/In Progress/Done views.\n- Publish docs/wiki pages to the GitHub wiki, initializing the wiki in the UI if required.\n- Export issue/project state into versioned planning data at milestones.\n- Verify exports and wiki mirrors can be restored without an undocumented local dependency.\n\nSee docs/GITHUB.md for current publication status and recovery commands.\n",
