    "body": "After the graybox establishes a useful gameplay loop, define the original visual identity.\n\nAcceptance criteria:\n- Propose original silhouettes, palette, materials and ability readability rules.\n- Choose and document licensing for original production assets.\n- Establish a provenance manifest for source art, generated placeholders, exports and external assets.\n- Keep all engine-consumed assets reproducible without proprietary game data.\n\nSee assets/README.md.\n",
