    "body": "Use the playable duel foundation to explore the smallest team arena loop.\n\nAcceptance criteria:\n- Propose two original ability kits with pressure, defense and counterplay.\n- Record target match length, sustain rules and team composition assumptions.\n- Support four players, round end and rematch in one graybox arena.\n- Run a human playtest and record readability, confusing deaths, unused abilities and resulting design changes.\n\nNo copied game names, icons, sounds or assets.\n",
